  objectSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1e32f4836e96a104ea48d4a6cbd80f69, type: 3}
  questDescription: Bah, Farmer Hank here. This pitchfork snaps every time I toss
    a hay bale, so it needs to last. And the prongs should be properly sharp, not
    just poke around like a toothpick.
  requirements:
  - type: 1
    tier: 0
  - type: 3
    tier: 2
  successText: Well, I'll be! Hay flies like butter and nothing snaps! Best fork
    ever!
  partialText: Hmph. It's a fork. It forks. Fine.
  failureText: Useless! I've met turnips with more sense than this fork!
